---
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="border-b border-border py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6">
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold text-balance text-foreground md:text-5xl">
      Start a job. Review the proposal. Then it is the case.
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="border border-border bg-card">
        <div class="border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          job
        </div>
        <div class="px-5 py-8 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-muted-foreground">$ wd jobs start</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-foreground">--cap network.dns.lookup</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-muted-foreground">status: queued</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border px-5 py-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground">Collect</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Jobs run only when you start them. Each run returns evidence and a proposal, not a write
            to the case.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-border bg-card">
        <div class="border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          inbox
        </div>
        <div class="px-5 py-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">1 proposal</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-foreground">Claim + cited evidence</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="inline-flex h-8 items-center border border-border px-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              Reject
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex h-8 items-center bg-foreground px-3 text-xs text-background">
              Accept
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border px-5 py-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground">Decide</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            A person accepts or rejects each proposal. Accepting can mark it confirmed, but only when
            there's evidence to back it up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-border bg-card">
        <div class="border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          export
        </div>
        <div class="px-5 py-8 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <p>example/</p>
          <p class="mt-2 pl-4 text-foreground">entity.md</p>
          <p class="pl-4">evidence/</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-foreground">path: example-….zip</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border px-5 py-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground">Export</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            The whole case exports as a package you can hand to someone else.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
